/**
 * MorphDrive 3D — Shared First-Person Vehicle Camera
 *
 * One camera controller for all 16 supported vehicles.
 * Vehicle-specific settings describe the longitudinal axis,
 * forward direction, camera height, and driver-seat offset.
 *
 * All positions are calculated from the normalized vehicle bounds.
 */

